---
// ABOUTME: AI content warning component for articles heavily written by AI
// ABOUTME: Displays a prominent warning box to indicate AI-generated content
---

<div class="ai-warning">
  <div class="ai-warning-icon">⚠️</div>
  <div class="ai-warning-content">
    <strong>This article was heavily written by AI.</strong>
    <p>More than 90% of this article was written by AI. While that doesn't mean it's total garbage, you should skim read it with appropriate context.</p>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .ai-warning { display: flex; gap: 12px; padding: 20px; margin: 24px 0; background: var(--color-background-alt); border-radius: 4px; }
  .ai-warning-content strong { display: block; margin-bottom: 6px; }
  .ai-warning-content p { margin: 0; font-size: 14px; color: var(--color-text-muted); }
</style>
